WEBVTT

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:19.700
<i>A-Amazing...</i>

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:34.420
<b><i>Maji LOVE 2000%</i></b>

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:36.050
That was surprising, wasn't it, Hyuga?

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:38.670
I had no idea they were this good.

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:45.760
Their scorching singing still burns in my skin.

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:49.890
HE☆VENS has shown us something truly unbelievable.

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:48.390
Thank you!

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:50.640
Bang.

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:53.860
How can they be so good?

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:56.190
I can't believe they're amateurs.

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:58.820
They've grown even stronger than before.

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:17.090
<i>You'll happily become our composer.</i>

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:21.340
<i>Come with us. We'll show you a fantastic dream.</i>

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:27.640
Good morning, everyone.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:30.230
Reporter Tsukimiya Ringo here.

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:32.140
Ringo!

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:35.310
Well done, HE☆VENS.

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:39.780
Having finished singing first in the stage battle, how do you feel?

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:43.860
This is nonsense.

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:44.320
Huh?

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:49.120
Challenging us was foolish.

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:52.500
HE☆VENS' victory was decided long ago.

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:56.630
ST☆RISH, you should start thinking of what you want to say

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:58.960
when your group is dissolved.

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:01.210
Nagi, you're so cute!

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:04.090
So cute!

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:04.090
Those guys...

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:06.220
Nagi's so cute!

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:10.970
Wouldn't you rather see us perform instead of this farce, angels?

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:25.030
HE☆VENS concert! HE☆VENS concert! HE☆VENS concert!

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:23.990
That's right. That's what you want to see.

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:28.580
HE☆VENS has already announced their victory!

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:31.450
They are calling for their own concert!

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:35.620
This isn't good. At this rate, they...

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:39.000
Hey.

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:44.760
You know they can't rely on anyone else onstage.

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:46.550
I know.

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:48.800
I know, but...

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.850
Once the curtain goes up,

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:54.390
they're the only ones who can bring it back down.

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:02.730
ST☆RISH is experiencing the overwhelming power of HE☆VENS.

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:07.530
After their impressive debut song, "Maji LOVE 1000%,"

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:09.950
what will they sing next?

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:13.120
Wait and see after this!

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:19.420
HE☆VENS concert! HE☆VENS concert! HE☆VENS concert!

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:16.160
What's going to happen, Haruka?

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:19.420
Haruka?

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:26.010
It's been a while, Saotome.

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:28.840
I must thank you.

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:32.260
That girl's song is impressive.

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:36.940
To think it could empower HE☆VENS so much...

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:39.770
I am grateful to you, as well.

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:40.730
What?

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:47.780
Danke schön for creating a wonderful arrangement for Miss Nanami's song.

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:51.700
Thanks to you, my test was a success!

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:54.370
A test?

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:57.660
I wanted to see if the special type of wave

00:05:57.660 --> 00:06:04.170
in Miss Nanami's songs would disappear with another person's arrangement.

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:08.430
What are you doing?

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:13.260
Pursuing one of the few waves in this world...

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:16.140
The Happy Pulse.

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:23.610
Shining Agency

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:26.530
They're unbelievable.

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:29.990
I can't believe that was Nanami's song.

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:32.280
It had such intensity.

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:35.490
Huh? What's wrong?

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:38.790
It's really gloomy in here.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:40.330
You.

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:41.420
What are you doing here?

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:44.710
We have no more business with you.

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:47.920
We have won. Come with me.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:49.420
Stop!

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:58.390
No matter what happens, I will never stop being ST☆RISH's composer.

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:01.900
Didn't you see us perform?

00:07:02.600 --> 00:07:07.320
We are the ones who can make the most of your songs.

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:11.820
With us and your songs, we can create the greatest music in the world.

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:13.070
You're wrong.

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:20.830
ST☆RISH sings my songs more wonderfully than anyone else.

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:23.580
Nanami.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:24.830
Lady.

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:27.710
Are you saying we can't do it?

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:31.470
She rejected him.

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:34.010
Kira, don't put it so bluntly.

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:39.720
You've got some nerve, turning down HE☆VENS' invitation.

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:42.350
Don't come crying to us if you regret it later.

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:45.230
Interesting.

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:47.900
If you're so sure about that, I look forward to seeing you perform.

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:55.620
Those guys...

00:07:56.320 --> 00:07:59.620
Nanami, don't worry. I promise we'll...

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:04.080
Ittoki, everyone.

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:10.050
In my eyes, you're all eternally twinkling stars.

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:14.180
Your voices make people happy.

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:16.680
That is why I want you to give it to them.

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:18.760
Nanami.

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:20.180
Haru.

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:21.890
We know.

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:23.770
We all feel the same way.

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:27.060
Yeah. We sing for our fans.

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:28.360
Yes.

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:36.570
Even if this is our last performance, I...

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:39.870
Otoya.

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:48.380
Otoya, don't think about anything else right now.

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:51.420
Let us deliver our music to them.

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:57.970
<i>We want to deliver our music to everyone. That's all.</i>

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:01.850
In order to follow through with what you've set out to do,

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:04.180
you must believe in yourself.

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:09.150
Guys.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:27.830
ST☆RISH! ST☆RISH! ST☆RISH!

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:18.280
This is...

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:21.700
They're waiting for us.

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:22.700
Let's go.

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:25.210
Let's settle this once and for all!

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:26.290
Yeah!

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:26.960
Yes!

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:36.630
<i>The Happy Pulse?</i>

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:43.060
<i>That's right. A wave that fills those who hear it with happiness.</i>

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:49.690
<i>I've been searching for a wave like this for years,</i>

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:51.400
<i>and I have finally found it.</i>

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:54.690
<i>Although it was only a little, I successfully captured some.</i>

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:57.950
<i>For my next experiment...</i>

00:09:58.360 --> 00:10:01.780
With so much time on your hands, you've lost sight of reality.

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:04.870
You are no longer a threat to me.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:16.460
May everyone be connected, and may this happiness reach them.

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:20.010
May the muses watch over us.

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:22.600
Okay, let's go!

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:28.480
Beyond 1000%!

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.160
What is this?

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:14.370
This is...

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:16.170
Those boys...

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:32.100
What...

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:35.560
What is this warm and comforting wave?

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:42.320
<i>That's right. A wave that fills those who hear it with happiness.</i>

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:49.200
<i>Happiness... Saotome, have you discovered the secrets of music?</i>

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:01.300
<i>This wave...</i>

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:04.800
<i>ST☆</i>RISH!

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:12.140
<i>Their voices are stripping my heart bare and coloring it with happiness!</i>

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:21.400
What an infinitely large Happy Pulse.

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:24.940
A wave far greater than anything I imagined.

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:02.020
Unbelievable...

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:05.610
Happy. I'm happy.

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:06.650
Kira.

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:10.910
So, this is the power of 2000%.

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:15.790
How... how can such a song exist?

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:22.250
Fantasistas. They're the world's greatest fantasistas!

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:28.510
No one can deny you've shocked the world, ST☆RISH!

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:40.230
It's a miracle.

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:43.270
Are you sure you didn't start spinning in the middle?

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:46.320
What? I don't think I did...

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:50.360
It was such a comfortable and dream-like feeling.

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:53.870
I felt like I saw the edge of the universe.

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:57.870
Everyone joined together as one, and they were filled with a warm feeling.

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:01.420
I've never felt anything like this.

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:04.710
Is it because we sang our hearts out?

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:21.390
What was that just now? Were we really here in this concert hall?

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:26.270
I've never heard a song like this before! Is everyone all right?

00:15:26.270 --> 00:15:30.360
It's time to move on to the results!

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:33.490
For the first time in the history of the Uta☆Pri Award,

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:35.160
two groups have been nominated.

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:37.660
We have experienced an unbelievable and

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:41.660
dream-like world of song at the hands of these two young groups.

00:15:41.660 --> 00:15:44.670
On whose heads will the crown of victory sparkle?

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:48.630
Will it be HE☆VENS, or will it be ST☆RISH?

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:50.050
Which is it?

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:53.970
Wait!

00:15:58.760 --> 00:16:03.100
There is no need for the judges' results!

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:09.150
This battle has already been decided.

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:10.230
But we haven't seen the scores yet!

00:16:10.230 --> 00:16:11.690
Don't you understand?

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:19.660
The desire to make others happy with their music...

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:23.580
Their music is several levels higher.

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:36.760
It's ST☆RISH! The favorite, HE☆VENS, has been defeated!

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:39.180
It's the birth of a new star!

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:41.220
Haruka!

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:42.640
Tomo!

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:46.810
All right!

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:55.240
We lost. I can't believe we lost...

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:59.740
The proud Raging Entertainment has no need for losers.

00:17:00.280 --> 00:17:04.160
I announce the dissolution of HE☆VENS here and now!

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:07.250
No, don't!

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:08.380
Wait!

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:10.630
Don't disband them!

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:16.380
We don't consider ourselves victors.

00:17:16.380 --> 00:17:20.890
Is there really winning or losing when it comes to music, anyway?

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:23.770
We don't need your pity!

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:27.140
You misunderstand. Listen to their voices.

00:17:27.140 --> 00:17:28.310
Nagi!

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:29.560
Eiichi!

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:31.480
Don't disband!

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:32.280
Kira!

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:33.690
Angels...

00:17:35.440 --> 00:17:38.200
Please don't disband their group.

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:39.570
Please.

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:40.620
Please.

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:41.830
Please.

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:42.870
Please.

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:43.830
Please.

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:45.290
Please.

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:47.330
ST☆RISH...

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:49.290
Wh-What's this?

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:55.170
Fools. Do you really believe I could do that?

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:00.720
I see, I see.

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:03.470
Mr. Raging, are you familiar with the other prizes

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:06.140
awarded at this concert hall?

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:09.190
I will do anything the victor desires.

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:14.690
Yes, any wish can be granted!

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:23.080
In other words, HE☆VENS does not need to be disbanded!

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:31.790
If that is your wish, no one will oppose your desire!

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:35.590
HE☆VENS has escaped dissolution!

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:36.840
What good news!

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:36.840
Unbelievable.

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:38.170
How could this happen?

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:43.140
Saotome, I accept your proposal.

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:56.650
I don't owe you anything, Saotome. Someday...

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:02.620
There's no winning or losing in music, huh?

00:19:03.570 --> 00:19:05.280
Sounds like something they'd say.

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:12.880
Ran-Ran, where are you going? The award ceremony's still coming up.

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:16.170
I can't sit still after watching that concert.

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:17.460
What?

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:21.760
If we're going to do this, there will be no half-measures.

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:23.970
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:27.350
About Quartet Night, of course!

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:29.060
Ran-Ran.

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:37.070
Let's go! Let's go!

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:38.320
Wh-What are you doing?

00:19:40.320 --> 00:19:43.860
I can't believe there's something I cannot have.

00:19:43.860 --> 00:19:45.830
Don't think this is over.

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:48.450
Over? Impossible.

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:49.830
It's just getting started.

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:56.960
We have another request.

00:19:56.960 --> 00:20:00.420
Could we have a little more of your time?

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:02.880
We want to sing more!

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:04.550
What?

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:08.010
If we sing our song...

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:10.020
With everyone here...

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:11.930
If we sing together, surely...

00:20:11.930 --> 00:20:15.350
You will all be filled with happiness.

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:30.200
Nothing can stop you now!

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:32.910
Are you ready?

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:44.880
"Maji LOVE 1000%"!

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:54.310
It all started with this song.

00:21:01.730 --> 00:21:03.400
They're all so amazing!

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:26.300
<i>Could I have been changed that day by the power of their song?</i>

00:21:32.350 --> 00:21:33.270
<i>Mikaze.</i>

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:36.730
<i>Music that moves the heart...</i>

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:42.400
<i>To think there is still more I need to learn...</i>

00:21:50.410 --> 00:21:53.700
<i>Seven stars will change the world.</i>

00:21:54.950 --> 00:21:59.290
<i>I want to give people even more of this miraculous harmony.</i>

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:04.720
<i>After all, we're only just getting started.</i>

00:24:06.920 --> 00:24:08.950
We'll definitely see you again!

00:24:08.950 --> 00:24:10.240
UtaPri!
